ss=\"portal\"><h2>Adventures & quests</h2><ul><li><a href=\"advanced-loot.html\">Advanced loot</a><small>Personal drops, filters and group rolls.</small></li><li><a href=\"ascension.html\">Ascension quest</a><small>Reforge your original class epic.</small></li><li><a href=\"waypoints.html\">Waypoint Explorer</a><small>Discover destinations and earn a title.</small></li></ul></section></div><div class=\"home-columns\"><section><h2>New in Nightcap</h2><p><a href=\"dungeon-modes.html\"><strong>Raid or Grind in seven private dungeons.</strong></a> Complete personal boss checklists for new rewards, with exclusive Raid drops. Available for live testing.</p><p><strong>Build, craft and upgrade.</strong> Early spell scribing, stacked tradeskills and Craft All, reusable item upgrades, and equipment for your held classes are live. The <a href=\"item-upgrades.html#normal-items\">normal-item box recipe</a> is awaiting release.</p><p>Passive AA is now <strong>20%</strong> alongside normal leveling. <a href=\"recent-changes.html\">Read the latest changes →</a></p></section><section><h2>At the campfire</h2><ul><li><a href=\"commands.html\">Keep the command reference handy</a></li><li><a href=\"launcher.html\">Update your launcher and game</a></li><li><a href=\"combat.html\">Read about combat and recovery</a></li><li><a href=\"unreleased.html\">See what is still in development</a></li></ul><p class=\"notice\">Nightcap is in live testing. Feature labels distinguish installed systems from unreleased work.</p></section></div>\n<p class=\"notice\"><strong>Not released:</strong> Removing the EXP penalty from normal death is prepared for approval. It is not active yet. <a href=\"unreleased.html#death-exp\">See the candidate details.</a></p>\n<p class=\"notice\"><strong>Not released:</strong> Separate cooldowns for the six basic Monk attacks are prepared. Dragon Punch/Tail Rake, Eagle Strike, Flying Kick, Kick, Round Kick and Tiger Claw will each keep their own reuse time. <a href=\"unreleased.html#monk-cooldowns\">See the candidate details.</a></p>",
