   "slug": "recent-changes",
   "title": "Recent changes",
   "summary": "The latest player-facing changes reflected in this guide.",
-  "body": "<h2 id=\"death-exp-20261017\">October 17, 2026</h2><ul><li><strong>Not released:</strong> <a href=\"unreleased.html#death-exp\">No EXP loss on normal death</a> is prepared for approval and is not active yet.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-17\">October 17, 2026</h2><ul><li>A <a href=\"item-upgrades.html#normal-items\">Reforging Box fix for three identical Normal (Base) items</a> is tested and awaiting release. Higher upgrades still require four copies.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-16\">October 16, 2026</h2><ul><li>The <a href=\"dungeon-modes.html#required-bosses\">dungeon guide now lists every required boss</a> and explains boss-stage notices, full-clear credit and Keeper Status when task objectives are blank.</li><li><a href=\"dungeon-modes.html\">Raid and Grind dungeons</a> are deployed for live testing with personal boss checklists, shared rewards and exclusive Raid drops. Gameplay and balance acceptance remain open.</li><li><a href=\"features.html\">Features</a> now gathers the major departures from Classic.</li><li><a href=\"multiclass.html#equipment-access\">Equipment eligibility</a> recognizes held classes and permits playable races when the class matches; remaining restrictions still apply.</li><li><a href=\"combat.html#buffs\">Temporary AA buffs</a> retain their timers; ordinary blessings remain lasting.</li><li><a href=\"tunnel.html#banking\">Mira Coinwell</a> provides tunnel banking. Haldra stocks Leather Padding.</li><li>The wiki’s guides, commands and generated reward pages have been reviewed together against current release evidence.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-13\">October 13, 2026</h2><ul><li><a href=\"multiclass.html#passive-abilities\">Passive AA changed from 40% to 20%</a>, preserving full normal XP and 4,000 AA XP per point.</li><li><a href=\"multiclass.html#alternate-abilities\">All allowed AA ranks open at level 1</a>; points, eligibility and prerequisite ranks remain.</li><li><a href=\"tradeskills.html\">Stacked tradeskill ingredients and Craft All</a> are deployed.</li><li>The tunnel workshop layout is more spacious; the <a href=\"waypoints.html\">Unrest waypoint</a> moved beside its entrance Keeper.</li><li>Supported divine summoned-hammer families have <a href=\"equipment.html#summoned-gear\">zero resale value</a>.</li><li>The reported multiclass training/offhand issue and merchant Sell All button issue were confirmed resolved.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-12\">October 11–12, 2026</h2><ul><li><a href=\"item-upgrades.html\">Reusable four-copy upgrades</a> are available from Artisan Veyra; higher #zoneforge steps now use four copies.</li><li><a href=\"equipment.html#free-trade\">LORE restrictions are disabled</a>. Food and drink requirements were removed.</li><li><a href=\"multiclass.html#spell-access\">Early scribing</a> allows eligible scrolls into the spellbook before their casting level.</li><li><a href=\"equipment.html#selling\">Sell All protects food, drink, reagents and casting focus items</a>.</li><li>The launcher uses personal access codes and shows <a href=\"launcher.html#patch-notes\">patch summaries</a>.</li><li>Waypoint portals and floating-eye Instance Keepers received visual corrections. The reported pet-summon crash was confirmed resolved.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-9\">October 9, 2026</h2><ul><li><a href=\"zones.html\">48 Classic reward zones</a>, <a href=\"items.html\">384 reward variants</a>, type-22 augments and zone forging launched.</li><li>Passive AA increased to 40% at that time; the October 13 reduction above supersedes that rate.</li><li><a href=\"advanced-loot.html#row-controls\">Always Loot / Never Loot controls</a>, effective Spell Damage on <a href=\"combat.html#throw-stone\">Throw Stone</a>, and retained spell gems after normal death were added.</li></ul><p>Release labels describe availability, not completed balance or gameplay acceptance. See <a href=\"unreleased.html\">In development</a> for candidates.</p>",
+  "body": "<h2 id=\"monk-cooldowns-20261017\">October 17, 2026: Monk cooldown candidate</h2><ul><li><strong>Not released:</strong> <a href=\"unreleased.html#monk-cooldowns\">Independent cooldowns for all six basic Monk attacks</a> are prepared and awaiting paired client/server release.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"death-exp-20261017\">October 17, 2026</h2><ul><li><strong>Not released:</strong> <a href=\"unreleased.html#death-exp\">No EXP loss on normal death</a> is prepared for approval and is not active yet.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-17\">October 17, 2026</h2><ul><li>A <a href=\"item-upgrades.html#normal-items\">Reforging Box fix for three identical Normal (Base) items</a> is tested and awaiting release. Higher upgrades still require four copies.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-16\">October 16, 2026</h2><ul><li>The <a href=\"dungeon-modes.html#required-bosses\">dungeon guide now lists every required boss</a> and explains boss-stage notices, full-clear credit and Keeper Status when task objectives are blank.</li><li><a href=\"dungeon-modes.html\">Raid and Grind dungeons</a> are deployed for live testing with personal boss checklists, shared rewards and exclusive Raid drops. Gameplay and balance acceptance remain open.</li><li><a href=\"features.html\">Features</a> now gathers the major departures from Classic.</li><li><a href=\"multiclass.html#equipment-access\">Equipment eligibility</a> recognizes held classes and permits playable races when the class matches; remaining restrictions still apply.</li><li><a href=\"combat.html#buffs\">Temporary AA buffs</a> retain their timers; ordinary blessings remain lasting.</li><li><a href=\"tunnel.html#banking\">Mira Coinwell</a> provides tunnel banking. Haldra stocks Leather Padding.</li><li>The wiki’s guides, commands and generated reward pages have been reviewed together against current release evidence.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-13\">October 13, 2026</h2><ul><li><a href=\"multiclass.html#passive-abilities\">Passive AA changed from 40% to 20%</a>, preserving full normal XP and 4,000 AA XP per point.</li><li><a href=\"multiclass.html#alternate-abilities\">All allowed AA ranks open at level 1</a>; points, eligibility and prerequisite ranks remain.</li><li><a href=\"tradeskills.html\">Stacked tradeskill ingredients and Craft All</a> are deployed.</li><li>The tunnel workshop layout is more spacious; the <a href=\"waypoints.html\">Unrest waypoint</a> moved beside its entrance Keeper.</li><li>Supported divine summoned-hammer families have <a href=\"equipment.html#summoned-gear\">zero resale value</a>.</li><li>The reported multiclass training/offhand issue and merchant Sell All button issue were confirmed resolved.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-12\">October 11–12, 2026</h2><ul><li><a href=\"item-upgrades.html\">Reusable four-copy upgrades</a> are available from Artisan Veyra; higher #zoneforge steps now use four copies.</li><li><a href=\"equipment.html#free-trade\">LORE restrictions are disabled</a>. Food and drink requirements were removed.</li><li><a href=\"multiclass.html#spell-access\">Early scribing</a> allows eligible scrolls into the spellbook before their casting level.</li><li><a href=\"equipment.html#selling\">Sell All protects food, drink, reagents and casting focus items</a>.</li><li>The launcher uses personal access codes and shows <a href=\"launcher.html#patch-notes\">patch summaries</a>.</li><li>Waypoint portals and floating-eye Instance Keepers received visual corrections. The reported pet-summon crash was confirmed resolved.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"october-9\">October 9, 2026</h2><ul><li><a href=\"zones.html\">48 Classic reward zones</a>, <a href=\"items.html\">384 reward variants</a>, type-22 augments and zone forging launched.</li><li>Passive AA increased to 40% at that time; the October 13 reduction above supersedes that rate.</li><li><a href=\"advanced-loot.html#row-controls\">Always Loot / Never Loot controls</a>, effective Spell Damage on <a href=\"combat.html#throw-stone\">Throw Stone</a>, and retained spell gems after normal death were added.</li></ul><p>Release labels describe availability, not completed balance or gameplay acceptance. See <a href=\"unreleased.html\">In development</a> for candidates.</p>",
